  "description": "<h3><strong>What does this mod do?</strong></h3>\n<p>Annoyed or unhappy with the amount of aim punch in Tarkov? Now you can tweak it to your liking! Simply install the mod, open up the <strong>F12</strong> menu and set the % amount to shake the camera when shot at. 0% completely negates the effect!</p>\n",
